== Trivia ==
*Despite its recipe being unlocked at {{Coll|Spider Slayer 5}}, it can be used at {{Coll|Spider Slayer 3}}. It is unknown whether this is a bug or intentional.
*The '''Spider Shortbow''' used to be called the '''Scorpion Bow'''. Its old ability, {{AN|Stinger}}, would cause fully charged shots while sneaking to slow the victim and deal {{Red|35x}} the player's {{Stat|str}} as damage per second for {{Green|6s}}.

